OL,3,GNEWSA'Smells and dust' concern over
OL,4,Aasbestos waste site
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents and businesses near a
OL,7,Flandfill site have claimed that dust
OL,8,Fand odours from the waste facility are
OL,9,Fmaking people feel unwell.
OL,11,FA motocross track has even had to close
OL,12,Fafter riders, including children,
OL,13,Fcomplained of headaches and dizziness
OL,14,Fthey blamed on the smell coming from
OL,15,Fthe site in Finningley, near Doncaster.
OL,17,FLocals have also reported flies being
OL,18,Fattracted to the waste, and the
OL,19,FEnvironment Agency (EA) is now
OL,20,Finvestigating.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
