OL,3,GNEWSA'Smells and dust' concern over
OL,4,Aasbestos waste site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe landfill in a former quarry is
OL,7,Foperated by Tetron Finningley Ltd,
OL,8,Fwhich did not respond when contacted
OL,9,Ffor comment by the BBC.
